Description: GTK4/Libadwaita application for data recovery
 A GTK4/Libadwaita application for data recovery using ddrescue and PhotoRec.
 Recovers all files (not just deleted ones) from storage devices or disk
 images, organises them by file type, and optionally removes duplicates
 using rdfind.
